{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01517",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.25,
      "end_seconds": 5.93,
      "duration_seconds": 4.68,
      "text": "Hello, take a seat, I'll be with you in a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 7.3,
      "end_seconds": 8.51,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "Hello, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.56,
      "end_seconds": 12.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "Start wherever you like, I'm listening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.4,
      "end_seconds": 18.73,
      "duration_seconds": 4.33,
      "text": "So, I've been getting out of breath, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.79,
      "end_seconds": 35.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "How long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 37.6,
      "end_seconds": 40.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "It's, It's been three days now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 41.72,
      "end_seconds": 51.85,
      "duration_seconds": 10.13,
      "text": "Tell me a a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.71,
      "end_seconds": 64.8,
      "duration_seconds": 11.09,
      "text": "It feels moderate to me. Yes, stairs. That makes it worse. I mean, I've been putting on weight over the years too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.03,
      "end_seconds": 66.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.07,
      "text": "Hm, okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.13,
      "end_seconds": 80.45,
      "duration_seconds": 5.32,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any low mood or palpitations?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.2,
      "end_seconds": 86.96,
      "duration_seconds": 5.76,
      "text": "I mean, I haven't had low mood or palpitations, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.36,
      "end_seconds": 91.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Any chest pain or high thirst?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.06,
      "end_seconds": 95.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "No, I haven't had any of them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.45,
      "end_seconds": 100.57,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "Any pins and needles or loss of strength anywhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.04,
      "end_seconds": 103.43,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "Nothing odd there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.06,
      "end_seconds": 109.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.04,
      "end_seconds": 116.73,
      "duration_seconds": 4.69,
      "text": "I'm allergic to diclofenac, I get swelling of my lips."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.69,
      "end_seconds": 121.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "Are you on any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.33,
      "end_seconds": 125.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "Nothing regular, um, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.01,
      "end_seconds": 127.24,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "Are you active?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.6,
      "end_seconds": 131.91,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "I walk the dog every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.92,
      "end_seconds": 136.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "what do you do during the day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 136.86,
      "end_seconds": 140.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "I look after my grandchildren most days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.2,
      "end_seconds": 143.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "How are your meals?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.6,
      "end_seconds": 153.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "I grab fast food at lunch most days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.05,
      "end_seconds": 156.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Have you had any surgical procedures?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 157.38,
      "end_seconds": 163.19,
      "duration_seconds": 5.81,
      "text": "Yes, I had a meniscus repair on my knee, four years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.68,
      "end_seconds": 176.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.06,
      "text": "What about your parents, brothers or sisters, any conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 178.06,
      "end_seconds": 180.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "My aunt has rheumatoid arthritis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 181.35,
      "end_seconds": 184.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "Any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 185.68,
      "end_seconds": 189.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "No, um, nothing at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.76,
      "end_seconds": 193.46,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "Let's move on to the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 195.18,
      "end_seconds": 196.16,
      "duration_seconds": 0.98,
      "text": "Sure thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 197.3,
      "end_seconds": 200.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "Take a a deep breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.86,
      "end_seconds": 212.8,
      "duration_seconds": 4.94,
      "text": "Your weight and waist measurement are both above the healthy range."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.04,
      "end_seconds": 234.49,
      "duration_seconds": 16.45,
      "text": "you can sit up now. Okay, so my impression is this: I think we're dealing with obesity with weight-related symptoms at this stage. The reason I say that is that your story and my examination fit together"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 235.82,
      "end_seconds": 237.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "is this serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.89,
      "end_seconds": 250.76,
      "duration_seconds": 11.87,
      "text": "I understand the worry at the moment I'd say it's obesity with weight-related symptoms, and we'll know more once the an HbA1c is back"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.02,
      "end_seconds": 296.21,
      "duration_seconds": 30.19,
      "text": "I'd like to arrange an HbA1c for obesity. I'd like to arrange a thyroid test for weight gain. Aim for a loss of half a kilo a week with smaller portions and a daily thirty-minute walk. Try to get to bed and wake up at the same time each day, and keep your phone away from the bed. The weight management service would be the right next step, I'll refer you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 297.07,
      "end_seconds": 316.96,
      "duration_seconds": 19.89,
      "text": "If it hasn't settled next month, we'd think about a cholesterol test, but not now. One warning sign to remember: the symptoms get worse. In that case don't wait. Please come and see me in three months. Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 317.99,
      "end_seconds": 321.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "good, thanks, I'll see you then"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 323.02,
      "end_seconds": 324.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "Look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}